sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant DP as DashboardPanel
    participant API as ApiClient
    participant S as FastAPI
    participant DB as Database

    Note over DP: onMounted → refresh() → loadStats()
    par 概览（后端接口不变）
        DP->>API: getProjectStatsSummary()
        API->>S: GET /api/stats/projects-summary
        S->>DB: count_saved_projects_period()
        DB-->>S: {today, month, quarter}
        S-->>API: JSON
        API-->>DP: summary
    and 趋势（强制折线）
        DP->>API: getProjectStatsTrend(range)
        API->>S: GET /api/stats/projects-trend?range
        S->>DB: project_*_counts()
        S-->>API: {range, labels, values}
        API-->>DP: trend
        DP->>DP: TrendChart 恒走折线+面积渲染（无柱状分支）
    and 分类统计（根级）
        DP->>API: getCategoryBreakdown(null)
        API->>S: GET /api/stats/category-breakdown
        S->>DB: category_breakdown(None)
        DB->>DB: list_categories_flat() → children_map 后序聚合
        DB-->>S: 根级直接子分类列表
        S-->>API: JSON 数组
        API-->>DP: catRows
    end

    Note over U,DP: 点击 has_children 行 → 下钻
    U->>DP: 点击某分类行
    DP->>DP: drillDown(row): catPath.push, catParentId=row.id
    DP->>API: getCategoryBreakdown(row.id)
    API->>S: GET /api/stats/category-breakdown?parent_id=row.id
    S->>DB: category_breakdown(row.id)
    DB-->>S: 直接子分类列表
    S-->>API: JSON 数组
    API-->>DP: catRows(子级)

    Note over U,DP: 返回上一级 / 回到顶级
    U->>DP: 点击「返回上一级」
    DP->>DP: goUp(): catPath.pop(), catParentId=上级
    DP->>API: getCategoryBreakdown(catParentId)
    API-->>DP: catRows(上级)
    U->>DP: 点击「回到顶级」
    DP->>DP: goTop(): catPath=[], catParentId=null
    DP->>API: getCategoryBreakdown(null)
    API-->>DP: catRows(根级)
